# .streamlit/secrets.toml.example
# CityPulse - Streamlit Secrets Configuration Template
# 
# To enable Google Maps in CityPulse:
# 1. Copy this file to .streamlit/secrets.toml:
#    cp .streamlit/secrets.toml.example .streamlit/secrets.toml
# 2. Replace YOUR_KEY_HERE with your Google Cloud Maps JavaScript API key.
# 
# NOTE: .streamlit/secrets.toml is git-ignored and will NEVER be committed.
#
# GOOGLE CLOUD SETUP:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console (https://console.cloud.google.com/)
# 2. Create or select your project.
# 3. Enable the "Maps JavaScript API" in APIs & Services.
# 4. Generate an API Key under APIs & Services > Credentials.
# 5. Restrict the key:
#    - API restrictions: Restrict key to "Maps JavaScript API"
#    - Application restrictions: HTTP referrers (e.g. localhost:8501/* or your custom domain)

